OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeen completes hospital abseil
OL,4,Aafter knee surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager from Dover has abseiled down
OL,7,FSt Thomas' Hospital in London following
OL,8,Fa successful surgery that corrected a
OL,9,Frare knee condition.
OL,11,FLacey Ward, 18, was diagnosed with
OL,12,Fmiserable malalignment syndrome (MMS)
OL,13,Fat 14, and underwent three surgeries at
OL,14,Fthe Evelina London Children's Hospital
OL,15,Fto treat it.
OL,17,FAfter completing the 160ft (48.77m)
OL,18,Fdescent on Saturday when she raised
OL,19,F#600 for the children's hospital
OL,20,Fcharity, Ward said that despite being
OL,21,Fnervous, she was glad she completed it.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
