OL,3,GNEWSATeen completes hospital abseil
OL,4,Aafter knee surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Afterwards I felt very proud of myself
OL,7,Fas I pushed through my fear and
OL,8,Fcompleted it. It was very high and I
OL,9,Fdidn't think I could do it but I'm so
OL,10,Fglad I did," she said.
